      "id": "per_episode_rng",
      "finding": "Even in the original four-slot worker, every development episode captures idle state, begins organization-v050:<slot_id>, and calls owner.reseed(sampling_seed) before building its runtime. reseed invokes torch.manual_seed(seed), records CPU/CUDA RNG hashes, and does not choose a new seed. Episode finally closes the evaluation window and restores captured Torch CPU/CUDA RNG with finish_evaluation_guard; the outer worker guard repeats the unchanged-learning and restored-RNG checks. Therefore the next old slot did not intentionally inherit the previous slot's Torch sampling stream.",
