      "id": "per_slot_world_and_sessions",
      "finding": "original._collect calls _new_prepared for each slot at that slot's own directory. The builder requires a fresh root, deep-copies baseline bundles into private member objects, creates a fresh world and TestBudget, and recomputes initial diagnostic preparation. build_runtime creates a fresh O1TeamBudget, recorder, ports, workers and SDK conversation directories, resets the runtime cursor to first_member, and close_runtime closes every policy. No business workspace, member conversation, team budget, test budget or fairness cursor is reused from the previous old slot.",
