    {
      "id": "allocator_wrapper",
      "finding": "The separate r3 reservation wrapper uses torch.empty uint8 allocations and releases all temporary tensors before a native call; it does not sample random tensors, reseed or alter native arguments/results. It wraps _generate_tokens and learning_logprobs and restores the owner attributes afterward. This supports absence of an intentional RNG change; allocation timing and resource-failure behavior do change under the disclosed resource policy.",
